# Intro
Hi, I'm Fanshuo MA. I'm interested in [Granular Material](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Granular_material) .\
Many thanks to [authors](/src/AUTHORS) and the others who make contributions to this community, which allows me to catch the essential functions of this program.

# Topic

Subjets on Non-Newtonian $2D$ flow behaviours are listed below :

* [Chute flow over inclined plane with various rheologies](/sandbox/fanshuo/TEST/).\
(Bingham, $\mu(I)$, cohesive granular, turbulent with Prandtl mixing length)
* [Avalanche of fluides](/sandbox/fanshuo/TEST/).
* [Collpase of masse, considering different rheologies](/sandbox/fanshuo/TEST/).